BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:tilos-agios-panteleimon-monastery-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-mo-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270726
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270729
SUMMARY:Panigiri of Agios Panteleimon (monastery)
LOCATION:Agios Panteleimon monastery\, Tilos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The island's biggest panigiri — three days at the fortified Agios Panteleimon monastery on the green slopes of Profitis Ilias. Pilgrims come from across the Dodecanese for the liturgy to the island's patron\, the healer saint\, and the celebration runs on live music\, dancing and free food and wine deep into the night. The monastery is about 8km from Megalo Chorio.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/tilos/#agios-panteleimon-monastery-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-mo
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/tilos/#agios-panteleimon-monastery-panigiri-of-agios-panteleimon-mo
END:VEVENT
